  "npcs": [
    {
      "entry": 24560,
      "name": "Priestess Delrissa",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:24560:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:c53216fac30de40272b5496e",
            "source:5477d13a33abde7659c3e0b8",
            "source:c7468f2f2af30dabd9d6493d",
            "source:7ac9d4c016211eaf306b5835",
            "source:1f4346b3198637e7db244a70",
            "source:dec435125ac9dead3dbcd965",
            "source:4e47eada75fa389cfcfe980c",
            "source:3f501f21716196cb73c9fbb3"
          ],
          "text": "Priestess Delrissa leads her lackeys against intruders. As they fall she vows to finish the intruders herself, mocks their dwindling group, and at the end admits things did not go as she planned. Her lines mix confident, cutting humor with a rare glimpse of frustration.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 24560
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 24664,
      "name": "Kael'thas Sunstrider",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:24664:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:346272a5a0541acf1092275e",
            "source:34ee25a729c316b1b07ee7db",
            "source:e8bb39429aa8cfbf6f9cc0ac",
            "source:809d11a96cd2a3d176ba0642",
            "source:3477cc1a76f693c25f50991c",
            "source:726b55a606c5236342bf66a9"
          ],
          "text": "Kael'thas Sunstrider, Lord of the Blood Elves, calls his defeat at Tempest Keep merely a setback and scorns the idea that he would trust the future to a blind, half-night elf mongrel. He fights with vengeance and asks his master for strength. Dying, he warns that his demise accomplishes nothing, that the master will have his killers, and that the world shall burn.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 24664
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "Lord of the Blood Elves"
    },
    {
